    (4044, 'eng', 'long', 'On the journey home, the color left in the sky settles gently into the heart. During a patient wait, the letter in the mailbox makes tomorrow feel a little less uncertain. Near the end of day, the music near the station keeps a tender moment from disappearing.', 'Share the conclusion, the evidence, and the next step in the same note. Reliable collaboration depends on sharing judgment as openly as the final result. A useful meeting ends with clear actions instead of impressive speeches.'),
    (4045, 'eng', 'long', 'When escape becomes possible, we did not lose time as much as we lost the courage to speak honestly, and letting go would be easier, but I did not come here for an easy ending.', 'Long meetings quietly teach everyone how to check the clock without moving. Human determination is impressive, but alarms, snacks, and refrigerators remain worthy rivals. After three alarms, even a sleepy person becomes serious near fresh coffee.'),
    (4046, 'eng', 'long', 'When a careful plan changes, comparing your work with yesterday is usually more useful than comparing it with others, and people who are willing to ask questions often discover the deeper answer.', 'Do not trust the words final chance because we can still write another scene. A scene that looks like an ending can still leave room for one decisive choice. A closed door is not the end because we can still choose another road.'),
    (4047, 'eng', 'long', 'After a small success, a person is shaped less by failure than by the decision to try again, and confidence improves through practice just like any other skill.', 'The moon moves slightly farther from Earth each year and changes our days. Familiar landscapes contain scientific processes that careful observation can reveal. The starlight we see tonight began its journey far back in cosmic history.'),
    (4048, 'eng', 'long', 'Before beginning unfamiliar work, write down an important thought before asking memory to protect it, and important decisions are often clearer in the morning than late at night.', 'People who are willing to ask questions often discover the deeper answer. New knowledge becomes useful when we explain it, recall it, and test it in another setting. Learning begins faster when you can describe exactly what you do not know.'),
    (4049, 'eng', 'long', 'Before familiarity becomes carelessness, an old friendship remembers the path back even after a long time apart. Asking how another person feels matters most when you wait patiently for the answer.', 'An old friendship remembers the path back even after a long time apart. Gratitude and disappointment are both easier to handle when they are expressed before they grow. Gratitude should be spoken aloud even in the relationships that feel most familiar.'),
    (4050, 'eng', 'long', 'After a small success, a precise question can solve a blocked task faster than silent effort, and priority should follow real impact rather than the loudest request.', 'At the end of the walking path, a small flower moved gently in the evening breeze. Even a crowded day contains a moment when the surroundings become clear. We often remember a small and ordinary scene longer than the important events around it. Not having every answer suddenly felt acceptable, and the thought settled gently within me.'),
    (4051, 'eng', 'long', 'A peaceful weekend morning reminds us that comfort can be simple. At the edge of morning, the shadow moving across the wall makes an ordinary day feel quietly special. After an old promise, the leaf at the edge of a plant reveals beauty in the most ordinary places.', 'Opportunities become easier to notice after you begin to move. Even a difficult day can leave one good reason to begin again. Moving slowly is still progress when the direction remains clear.'),
    (4052, 'eng', 'long', 'When escape becomes possible, it matters less who arrived first than who is willing to remain at the end, and do not trust the words final chance because we can still write another scene.', 'Start a new habit at a size that can survive a difficult day. Small decisions about time and attention can change the shape of an entire day. Important decisions are often clearer in the morning than late at night.'),
    (4053, 'eng', 'long', 'When a choice feels difficult, explaining a difficult idea to someone else quickly reveals the missing pieces. At the same time, comparing your work with yesterday is usually more useful than comparing it with others.', 'Repeated mistakes often reveal a weak process rather than a careless person. A small warning given early can protect a team from a much larger problem later. Priority should follow real impact rather than the loudest request.'),
    (4054, 'eng', 'long', 'When the familiar method fails, moving slowly is still progress when the direction remains clear. At the same time, being a beginner means there is still plenty of room to grow.', 'A snack becomes most persuasive when the task on screen becomes difficult. A minor mistake can become the funniest story once enough time has passed. Opening the refrigerator without a plan still counts as a short expedition.'),
    (4055, 'eng', 'long', 'After the rain has passed, when a conversation stalls, confirm what the other person meant, and start a new habit at a size that can survive a difficult day.', 'It matters less who arrived first than who is willing to remain at the end. The direction of a story can change when someone moves before the fear is gone. If we run now the scene will stop, but one more step can change the story.'),
    (4056, 'eng', 'long', 'When old friends meet again, a struggling person may need steady company more than immediate advice, and a real apology includes a different action instead of a longer explanation.', 'A memory is partly rebuilt each time the mind brings it back into awareness. Nature depends on networks and exchanges that are often invisible at first glance. An octopus has three hearts, and two of them move blood through the gills.'),
    (4057, 'eng', 'long', 'When the familiar method fails, a useful meeting ends with clear actions instead of impressive speeches. At the same time, check difficult work in small stages before errors become expensive.', 'Trying to recall a lesson one day later strengthens the path back to it. Once the unclear part is named precisely, the next step in studying becomes easier to see. Short sessions repeated over time often build stronger memories than one long session.'),
    (4058, 'eng', 'long', 'When the meeting ends, the shadow moving across the wall turns a brief pause into a lasting memory. At the edge of morning, the color left in the sky makes tomorrow feel a little less uncertain. When the meeting ends, the snow above the roofs holds more meaning than words can explain.', 'Sincerity often appears in the simple habit of keeping a promised time. Understanding another person does not require agreement, but it does require careful listening. Asking how another person feels matters most when you wait patiently for the answer.'),
    (4059, 'eng', 'long', 'When escape becomes possible, do not trust the words final chance because we can still write another scene. As long as one light remains, there is still a path that can lead us home.', 'When the music ended, only the clock and the soft hum of the room remained. Even a crowded day contains a moment when the surroundings become clear. The strength to face an ordinary day usually comes from affection that is already nearby. Whenever my heart feels uncertain, I think I can return to the calm of this scene.'),
    (4060, 'eng', 'long', 'When a choice feels difficult, short sessions repeated over time often build stronger memories than one long session, and a different point of view can reopen a problem when the familiar method fails.', 'Rest can be a wise part of progress rather than a sign of surrender. Growth often gathers quietly during the time when giving up would be easier. A person is shaped less by failure than by the decision to try again.');
